    "detailed_description": "<h1>Subscribe for more Everwayne news</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/7a7c1b02226e48a114c43612cf8fd1ab.poster.avif?t=1743760096\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/7a7c1b02226e48a114c43612cf8fd1ab.webm?t=1743760096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/7a7c1b02226e48a114c43612cf8fd1ab.mp4?t=1743760096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Tactical Trading Card Game (TCG) Roguelike by a Passionate Indie Studio</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/65d10cf22051297151416146907adc87.poster.avif?t=1743760096\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/65d10cf22051297151416146907adc87.webm?t=1743760096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/65d10cf22051297151416146907adc87.mp4?t=1743760096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our <strong>tactical trading card game (TCG)</strong> combines the stakes of <strong>roguelike</strong> gameplay with hand-drawn artistry and deep strategy. Created by our indie studio driven by passion for gaming, you can venture into the richly illustrated world of Everwayne, either alone or with a <strong>full squad </strong>of characters, to face the secrets of corruption and fight with hordes of different enemies.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/8d0443a00d90534bd9b9d5fed5137b3c.poster.avif?t=1743760096\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/8d0443a00d90534bd9b9d5fed5137b3c.webm?t=1743760096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/8d0443a00d90534bd9b9d5fed5137b3c.mp4?t=1743760096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Positioning for Strategic Depth</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo or Squad Play (up to 4 characters)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn-Based, Interactive, and Strategic Fights</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cExile\u201d Mechanics for Battlefield Control</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Synergy for Advanced Tactics</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tavern Meta-Progression System</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration in a Hand-Drawn World</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich Narrative with Choices</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Freedom of Playstyle: Explore, Fight, or Build</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>World Corruption Mechanic for Endless Replayability</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Camp Mechanics for Buffs and Card Upgrades</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/323a8fb91fec5c7019eb599f55855a23.poster.avif?t=1743760096\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/323a8fb91fec5c7019eb599f55855a23.webm?t=1743760096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/323a8fb91fec5c7019eb599f55855a23.mp4?t=1743760096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tactical Positioning: Master the Battlefield</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Positioning</strong> is a core element of Everwayne's <strong>turn-based combat</strong> system. As enemies attack, they target specific grid cells on the battlefield, not just your characters. To avoid damage or seize an advantage, you can use the <strong>Exile</strong> mechanic to tactically reposition characters, making positioning critical for survival and success in each battle.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/77735bfe166ce337a566dfd0e566117c.poster.avif?t=1743760096\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/77735bfe166ce337a566dfd0e566117c.webm?t=1743760096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/77735bfe166ce337a566dfd0e566117c.mp4?t=1743760096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play Solo or Lead a Squad up to Four</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can choose to start your journey with a single character or control a full <strong>squad of four</strong>. This <strong>tactical roguelite</strong> allows you to revive fallen characters during a run using special items and resources. The flexibility to switch between solo and squad modes ensures diverse gameplay, with multiple plot outcomes and endings based on your choices and play strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/bdb0cac580a9bed09341617f0eb9b0ad.poster.avif?t=1743760096\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/bdb0cac580a9bed09341617f0eb9b0ad.webm?t=1743760096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/bdb0cac580a9bed09341617f0eb9b0ad.mp4?t=1743760096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Turn-Based Combat with Strategic Run</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everwayne's <strong>turn-based combat</strong> isn\u2019t just about a card game. Environmental hazards can influence battles, forcing you to adapt your tactics. Environment adds depth to each fight, turning familiar situations into dynamic challenges that demand flexibility and foresight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/eeb0af7650b05cb9cf7efab6036afbd6.poster.avif?t=1743760096\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/eeb0af7650b05cb9cf7efab6036afbd6.webm?t=1743760096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/eeb0af7650b05cb9cf7efab6036afbd6.mp4?t=1743760096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The \u201cExile\u201d Mechanic: Manipulate the Battlefield</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Exile mechanic</strong> introduces a unique strategic element. Use <strong>special cards</strong> to push enemies into traps, environmental hazards, or stack debuffs on them. The Exile system allows you to manipulate both enemies and the battlefield, creating endless combinations of <strong>tactics</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/65d10cf22051297151416146907adc87.poster.avif?t=1743760096\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/65d10cf22051297151416146907adc87.webm?t=1743760096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/65d10cf22051297151416146907adc87.mp4?t=1743760096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Character Synergy: Build Powerful Deck</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this <strong>trading card game</strong>, each character has cards in a deck that create <strong>synergies</strong> with others. These synergies add a layer of <strong>strategy</strong> to squad play, allowing you to combine characters and manage a team deck to exploit enemy weaknesses and make <strong>OTK </strong>decks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/8d0443a00d90534bd9b9d5fed5137b3c.poster.avif?t=1743760096\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/8d0443a00d90534bd9b9d5fed5137b3c.webm?t=1743760096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/8d0443a00d90534bd9b9d5fed5137b3c.mp4?t=1743760096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tavern Meta-Progression: Your Hub of Growth</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Tavern</strong> acts as your primary hub, kinda forward operating base, where you can select characters, and take on quests from NPCs. As you progress, you\u2019ll upgrade the Tavern, unlocking new features like a <strong>Bestiary</strong>, Trophy Room, and even mini-games that allow you to gather resources and craft items. This <strong>meta-progression system</strong> ensures long-term engagement, offering new mechanics and challenges as you upgrade the <strong>Tavern.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/7497de147a5ce5d51017524cbeb8e342.poster.avif?t=1743760096\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/7497de147a5ce5d51017524cbeb8e342.webm?t=1743760096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/7497de147a5ce5d51017524cbeb8e342.mp4?t=1743760096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore a Hand-Drawn World Full of Secrets</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everwayne\u2019s world is beautifully <strong>hand-drawn</strong>, filled with interactive map elements and hidden secrets. As you walk through its lands, you\u2019ll uncover mysterious locations, dungeons, strategic advantages on the battlefield, and lore that deepens your understanding of the game's rich world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/cd3cb4cc71570707e1ff95c1790c2dca.poster.avif?t=1743760096\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/cd3cb4cc71570707e1ff95c1790c2dca.webm?t=1743760096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/cd3cb4cc71570707e1ff95c1790c2dca.mp4?t=1743760096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rich Narrative: A Story You Control</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game\u2019s rich <strong>narrative</strong> allows you to experience each character\u2019s story arc and their conflicts, filled with quests and side missions. The story is fully optional \u2014 if you prefer to focus on the <strong>TCG</strong> or <strong>roguelike</strong> elements, the choice is yours, but do not forget to take all bonus content!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/643fa98fe33e1373f8fb79a56f4b8552.poster.avif?t=1743760096\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/643fa98fe33e1373f8fb79a56f4b8552.webm?t=1743760096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/643fa98fe33e1373f8fb79a56f4b8552.mp4?t=1743760096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Freedom to Play Your Way</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you enjoy deep <strong>strategy</strong>, immersive <strong>narrative</strong>, or simply the challenge of <strong>endless roguelite</strong> gameplay, Everwayne offers <strong>freedom of playstyle</strong>. Some players may focus on the lore, while others will focus on mastering the <strong>turn-based combat</strong> and <strong>deck-building</strong> systems. With so much to explore, every player can find their niche in this fully hand-drawn world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/323a8fb91fec5c7019eb599f55855a23.poster.avif?t=1743760096\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/323a8fb91fec5c7019eb599f55855a23.webm?t=1743760096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/323a8fb91fec5c7019eb599f55855a23.mp4?t=1743760096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>World Corruption: A Dynamic and Endless Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, the world of Everwayne will change in response to your actions through the <strong>World Corruption</strong> mechanic. Each run influences the next, introducing <strong>endless replayability</strong> as you get new challenges, visual changes, and evolving mechanics. This makes each playthrough feel fresh, ensuring that no two experiences are the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/68d428739a7f16d20fef573522128f47.poster.avif?t=1743760096\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/68d428739a7f16d20fef573522128f47.webm?t=1743760096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/68d428739a7f16d20fef573522128f47.mp4?t=1743760096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Camp Mechanics: Prepare for the Next Challenge</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Camps in Everwane provide a respite in your journey. Here, you can <strong>restore health</strong>, gain powerful <strong>buffs</strong>, scout nearby areas, and upgrade your cards, all of which are essential for surviving the increasingly difficult battles ahead. These camp mechanics offer key strategic opportunities to strengthen your squad and fine-tune your deck each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/f013499304615a0e00e0669ae596c944.poster.avif?t=1743760096\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/f013499304615a0e00e0669ae596c944.webm?t=1743760096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/f013499304615a0e00e0669ae596c944.mp4?t=1743760096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Guardian: Will You Rise to the Challenge?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everwayne\u2019s world is held in the grip of a powerful <strong>guardian</strong>, the Eternal Tyrant, who has watched over the land for centuries. However, many believe his rule has caused the very corruption now spreading through the world. Will you be the adventurer who challenges this mighty guardian, uncovering the truth behind his reign, or will you simply try to survive and navigate the ever-changing landscape?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The choice is yours. Gather your best cards, build your deck, and use your <strong>tactical prowess</strong> to overcome the <strong>endless challenges</strong> that await. Every decision shapes your adventure as you confront powerful enemies, explore a hand-drawn world, and fight to determine the future of Everwayne.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/7a7c1b02226e48a114c43612cf8fd1ab.poster.avif?t=1743760096\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/7a7c1b02226e48a114c43612cf8fd1ab.webm?t=1743760096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/7a7c1b02226e48a114c43612cf8fd1ab.mp4?t=1743760096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Tactical Trading Card Game (TCG) Roguelike by a Passionate Indie Studio</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/65d10cf22051297151416146907adc87.poster.avif?t=1743760096\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/65d10cf22051297151416146907adc87.webm?t=1743760096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/65d10cf22051297151416146907adc87.mp4?t=1743760096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our <strong>tactical trading card game (TCG)</strong> combines the stakes of <strong>roguelike</strong> gameplay with hand-drawn artistry and deep strategy. Created by our indie studio driven by passion for gaming, you can venture into the richly illustrated world of Everwayne, either alone or with a <strong>full squad </strong>of characters, to face the secrets of corruption and fight with hordes of different enemies.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/8d0443a00d90534bd9b9d5fed5137b3c.poster.avif?t=1743760096\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/8d0443a00d90534bd9b9d5fed5137b3c.webm?t=1743760096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/8d0443a00d90534bd9b9d5fed5137b3c.mp4?t=1743760096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Positioning for Strategic Depth</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo or Squad Play (up to 4 characters)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn-Based, Interactive, and Strategic Fights</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cExile\u201d Mechanics for Battlefield Control</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Synergy for Advanced Tactics</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tavern Meta-Progression System</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration in a Hand-Drawn World</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich Narrative with Choices</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Freedom of Playstyle: Explore, Fight, or Build</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>World Corruption Mechanic for Endless Replayability</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Camp Mechanics for Buffs and Card Upgrades</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/323a8fb91fec5c7019eb599f55855a23.poster.avif?t=1743760096\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/323a8fb91fec5c7019eb599f55855a23.webm?t=1743760096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/323a8fb91fec5c7019eb599f55855a23.mp4?t=1743760096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tactical Positioning: Master the Battlefield</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Positioning</strong> is a core element of Everwayne's <strong>turn-based combat</strong> system. As enemies attack, they target specific grid cells on the battlefield, not just your characters. To avoid damage or seize an advantage, you can use the <strong>Exile</strong> mechanic to tactically reposition characters, making positioning critical for survival and success in each battle.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/77735bfe166ce337a566dfd0e566117c.poster.avif?t=1743760096\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/77735bfe166ce337a566dfd0e566117c.webm?t=1743760096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/77735bfe166ce337a566dfd0e566117c.mp4?t=1743760096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play Solo or Lead a Squad up to Four</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can choose to start your journey with a single character or control a full <strong>squad of four</strong>. This <strong>tactical roguelite</strong> allows you to revive fallen characters during a run using special items and resources. The flexibility to switch between solo and squad modes ensures diverse gameplay, with multiple plot outcomes and endings based on your choices and play strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/bdb0cac580a9bed09341617f0eb9b0ad.poster.avif?t=1743760096\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/bdb0cac580a9bed09341617f0eb9b0ad.webm?t=1743760096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/bdb0cac580a9bed09341617f0eb9b0ad.mp4?t=1743760096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Turn-Based Combat with Strategic Run</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everwayne's <strong>turn-based combat</strong> isn\u2019t just about a card game. Environmental hazards can influence battles, forcing you to adapt your tactics. Environment adds depth to each fight, turning familiar situations into dynamic challenges that demand flexibility and foresight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/eeb0af7650b05cb9cf7efab6036afbd6.poster.avif?t=1743760096\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/eeb0af7650b05cb9cf7efab6036afbd6.webm?t=1743760096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/eeb0af7650b05cb9cf7efab6036afbd6.mp4?t=1743760096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The \u201cExile\u201d Mechanic: Manipulate the Battlefield</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Exile mechanic</strong> introduces a unique strategic element. Use <strong>special cards</strong> to push enemies into traps, environmental hazards, or stack debuffs on them. The Exile system allows you to manipulate both enemies and the battlefield, creating endless combinations of <strong>tactics</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/65d10cf22051297151416146907adc87.poster.avif?t=1743760096\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/65d10cf22051297151416146907adc87.webm?t=1743760096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/65d10cf22051297151416146907adc87.mp4?t=1743760096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Character Synergy: Build Powerful Deck</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this <strong>trading card game</strong>, each character has cards in a deck that create <strong>synergies</strong> with others. These synergies add a layer of <strong>strategy</strong> to squad play, allowing you to combine characters and manage a team deck to exploit enemy weaknesses and make <strong>OTK </strong>decks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/8d0443a00d90534bd9b9d5fed5137b3c.poster.avif?t=1743760096\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/8d0443a00d90534bd9b9d5fed5137b3c.webm?t=1743760096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/8d0443a00d90534bd9b9d5fed5137b3c.mp4?t=1743760096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tavern Meta-Progression: Your Hub of Growth</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Tavern</strong> acts as your primary hub, kinda forward operating base, where you can select characters, and take on quests from NPCs. As you progress, you\u2019ll upgrade the Tavern, unlocking new features like a <strong>Bestiary</strong>, Trophy Room, and even mini-games that allow you to gather resources and craft items. This <strong>meta-progression system</strong> ensures long-term engagement, offering new mechanics and challenges as you upgrade the <strong>Tavern.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/7497de147a5ce5d51017524cbeb8e342.poster.avif?t=1743760096\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/7497de147a5ce5d51017524cbeb8e342.webm?t=1743760096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/7497de147a5ce5d51017524cbeb8e342.mp4?t=1743760096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore a Hand-Drawn World Full of Secrets</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everwayne\u2019s world is beautifully <strong>hand-drawn</strong>, filled with interactive map elements and hidden secrets. As you walk through its lands, you\u2019ll uncover mysterious locations, dungeons, strategic advantages on the battlefield, and lore that deepens your understanding of the game's rich world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/cd3cb4cc71570707e1ff95c1790c2dca.poster.avif?t=1743760096\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/cd3cb4cc71570707e1ff95c1790c2dca.webm?t=1743760096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/cd3cb4cc71570707e1ff95c1790c2dca.mp4?t=1743760096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rich Narrative: A Story You Control</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game\u2019s rich <strong>narrative</strong> allows you to experience each character\u2019s story arc and their conflicts, filled with quests and side missions. The story is fully optional \u2014 if you prefer to focus on the <strong>TCG</strong> or <strong>roguelike</strong> elements, the choice is yours, but do not forget to take all bonus content!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/643fa98fe33e1373f8fb79a56f4b8552.poster.avif?t=1743760096\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/643fa98fe33e1373f8fb79a56f4b8552.webm?t=1743760096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/643fa98fe33e1373f8fb79a56f4b8552.mp4?t=1743760096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Freedom to Play Your Way</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you enjoy deep <strong>strategy</strong>, immersive <strong>narrative</strong>, or simply the challenge of <strong>endless roguelite</strong> gameplay, Everwayne offers <strong>freedom of playstyle</strong>. Some players may focus on the lore, while others will focus on mastering the <strong>turn-based combat</strong> and <strong>deck-building</strong> systems. With so much to explore, every player can find their niche in this fully hand-drawn world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/323a8fb91fec5c7019eb599f55855a23.poster.avif?t=1743760096\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/323a8fb91fec5c7019eb599f55855a23.webm?t=1743760096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/323a8fb91fec5c7019eb599f55855a23.mp4?t=1743760096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>World Corruption: A Dynamic and Endless Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, the world of Everwayne will change in response to your actions through the <strong>World Corruption</strong> mechanic. Each run influences the next, introducing <strong>endless replayability</strong> as you get new challenges, visual changes, and evolving mechanics. This makes each playthrough feel fresh, ensuring that no two experiences are the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/68d428739a7f16d20fef573522128f47.poster.avif?t=1743760096\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/68d428739a7f16d20fef573522128f47.webm?t=1743760096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/68d428739a7f16d20fef573522128f47.mp4?t=1743760096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Camp Mechanics: Prepare for the Next Challenge</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Camps in Everwane provide a respite in your journey. Here, you can <strong>restore health</strong>, gain powerful <strong>buffs</strong>, scout nearby areas, and upgrade your cards, all of which are essential for surviving the increasingly difficult battles ahead. These camp mechanics offer key strategic opportunities to strengthen your squad and fine-tune your deck each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/f013499304615a0e00e0669ae596c944.poster.avif?t=1743760096\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/f013499304615a0e00e0669ae596c944.webm?t=1743760096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/f013499304615a0e00e0669ae596c944.mp4?t=1743760096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Guardian: Will You Rise to the Challenge?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everwayne\u2019s world is held in the grip of a powerful <strong>guardian</strong>, the Eternal Tyrant, who has watched over the land for centuries. However, many believe his rule has caused the very corruption now spreading through the world. Will you be the adventurer who challenges this mighty guardian, uncovering the truth behind his reign, or will you simply try to survive and navigate the ever-changing landscape?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The choice is yours. Gather your best cards, build your deck, and use your <strong>tactical prowess</strong> to overcome the <strong>endless challenges</strong> that await. Every decision shapes your adventure as you confront powerful enemies, explore a hand-drawn world, and fight to determine the future of Everwayne.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/7a7c1b02226e48a114c43612cf8fd1ab.poster.avif?t=1743760096\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/7a7c1b02226e48a114c43612cf8fd1ab.webm?t=1743760096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/7a7c1b02226e48a114c43612cf8fd1ab.mp4?t=1743760096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
